@startuml frontend_component_diagram
title Design Pattern Playground - Frontend component diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members

package "Bootstrap" {
  class main.jsx
  class App
}

package "Shell & Routing" {
  class SiteHeader
  class AuthDialog
  class VisualizationModal
  class usePlaygroundApp <<hook>>
  class playgroundUtils <<utils>>
  class playgroundConstants <<constants>>
  class api <<http client>>
}

package "Pages" {
  class HomePage
  class PatternPage
  class PatternQuizPage
  class QuizDashboardPage
  class NotFoundPage
}

package "Visualization" {
  class ExecutionScene
  class UmlDiagram
  class ZoomableViewport
  class CollapsiblePanel
}

package "Quiz Hooks & Utils" {
  class usePatternQuiz <<hook>>
  class usePatternQuizProgress <<hook>>
  class useQuizDashboard <<hook>>
  class quizUtils <<utils>>
}

package "Static Learning Data" {
  class fallbackPatterns
  class fallbackQuizzes
  class patternLearningContent
  class patternUmlDiagrams
}

main.jsx --> App

App --> SiteHeader
App --> AuthDialog
App --> VisualizationModal
App --> usePlaygroundApp
App --> HomePage
App --> PatternPage
App --> PatternQuizPage
App --> QuizDashboardPage
App --> NotFoundPage

usePlaygroundApp --> api
usePlaygroundApp --> playgroundUtils
usePlaygroundApp --> playgroundConstants
usePlaygroundApp --> fallbackPatterns
usePlaygroundApp --> patternLearningContent
usePlaygroundApp --> patternUmlDiagrams

PatternPage --> CollapsiblePanel
PatternPage --> ExecutionScene
PatternPage --> UmlDiagram
PatternPage --> playgroundUtils
PatternPage --> playgroundConstants

PatternQuizPage --> CollapsiblePanel
PatternQuizPage --> usePatternQuiz
PatternQuizPage --> usePatternQuizProgress
PatternQuizPage --> api
PatternQuizPage --> quizUtils
PatternQuizPage --> playgroundConstants

QuizDashboardPage --> useQuizDashboard
QuizDashboardPage --> playgroundConstants

ExecutionScene --> ZoomableViewport
UmlDiagram --> ZoomableViewport

usePatternQuiz --> api
usePatternQuiz --> fallbackQuizzes
usePatternQuiz --> quizUtils

usePatternQuizProgress --> api
useQuizDashboard --> api

note bottom of usePlaygroundApp
Hook d orchestration principal :
- routing local
- chargement catalogue/schema
- etat formulaire
- execution pattern
- auth et session
- modales UML / scene
end note

note right of api
Le client HTTP parle au backend via fetch
avec credentials: include pour les cookies HttpOnly.
end note

@enduml
